/-!
# spider_blocked_free_leg_opts

Topic: combinatorial_games   Node: 51190a7939e3

Provenance: helper lemma. step towards op211_three_legged_spider_eventual_parity

The contribution of the free leg (1,free) alone to the raw option list of (in;{(r,β),(1,free)}): the unique cut j = 1 with direction δ (never skipped, since φ = free) gives ρ(0;δ,free) xor the one-leg sub-state (update_centre in δ;{(r,β)}).
-/

/-- Options generated by the cut of the free leg (1,free) in (in;{(r,β),(1,free)}). -/
def spider_blocked_free_leg_opts (r : ℕ) (beta : SpiderLegEnd) : List ℕ := [SpiderLegEnd.inward, SpiderLegEnd.outward].filterMap (fun delta =>
    some (spider_rho 0 delta SpiderLegEnd.free ^^^
      spider_gamma (r + 1) (spider_update_centre CentreStatus.incoming delta) [(r, beta)]))
